<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>Update total quantity | CareCycle</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/app.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/donor.css"><script src="/app-nav.js" defer></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/ui-consistency.css"></head><body><%- include('partials/app-nav', { activePage: 'donations' }) %><main class="app-main donor-page"><section class="donor-panel"><h1>Update total quantity</h1><p><%= donation.equipment %>: <%= accounting.allocated %> units committed, <%= accounting.available %> units uncommitted.</p><p>Equipment details remain unchanged. Pending requests that exceed the new remaining quantity will be cancelled with a reason. Accepted commitments remain intact.</p><form class="listing-form" method="post" action="/donations/<%= donation._id %>/quantity"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="_version" value="<%= donation.__v || 0 %>"><label for="quantity">Total units offered</label><input id="quantity" name="quantity" type="number" min="<%= Math.max(1, accounting.allocated) %>" max="100" value="<%= accounting.total %>" required><button type="submit" class="primary-button">Save total quantity</button></form><p><a href="/donor/dashboard">Back to my listings</a></p></section></main></body></html>
